+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,14 @@
 ## [Unreleased]

+### Added
+
+- Library cover view uses the same three-column cover component, proportions and frames as Home, without book-name labels. Cover conversion runs on a low-priority disk-only worker, preparing visible books first and then other pages while idle. Swipes cancel taps before paging; holding a cover keeps the existing book menu. Display settings separate All books, Recently opened and List grouping. Library filters progress after the first paint instead of blocking entry; index reads reuse SD sectors rather than issuing a small read per folder.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Library cover view keeps its 3 × 3 grid while moving sorting into the menu and combining counts/pages in one compact footer. Covers use tight centered gaps, retain painted pixels, and update as a batch. Completed filtered/recent views are cached on SD, so returning to an unchanged library restores counts without rescanning. Missing covers show the book title inside a book outline; “Refresh covers on this page” retries those nine covers.
+
+- Library opens its saved index without an unconditional cold-boot scan and caches folder offsets for book lookups. Repeated missing-file checks no longer block opening the library. Transfers and detected SD file changes offer Refresh without blocking the saved library; a missing or incompatible index still requires an initial scan.

 - Image refresh blanks each image separately, keeping text between inline images visible while images are prepared for display. Pending images use an empty background instead of a temporary box border.

